		<key>readme</key>
		<string>Type the Movie Search Keyword (default: `movie`) or TV Search Keyword (default: `tv`), then a title. Results show the poster, rating, genres, and the director or number of seasons.

![](img/about/walle-search.png)

Press ↩ on a result for its details list: ratings from IMDb, Rotten Tomatoes and Metacritic, links to other sites, the trailer, and the cast. Press ↩ on a rating or link to open it, or ⌘C to copy an id.

![](img/about/walle-details.png)

Press ↩ on the title row to open the details window. Press ⌘1–⌘9 to open its links, and ⎋ / ← / ⌫ to go back.

![](img/about/walle-window.png)

Trailers open on YouTube, or in their own window with `Play trailers in Alfred` turned on in the Workflow’s Configuration.

Requires Alfred 6. On Alfred 5, use version 2.23.0.</string>
